      "content": "idk idk i'm just worried because the pain in my leg feels kinda heavy too. and the breathing part is making me a bit anxious. u sure i don't need to go to the clinic or anything? i'm pretty sure i'm just exhausted but i don't want to overreact if it's something serious.",
